@startuml TTL8_System
left to right direction
rectangle "Assembly source\n.asm" as asm
component "Lexer" as lexer
component "Parser" as parser
component "Symbol table" as symbols
component "Assembler" as assembler
artifact "Machine code\n.bin / .hex / .lst" as obj
component "TTL8 emulator\nCPU reference model" as emulator
database "256-byte memory" as ram
component "Output port" as output
artifact "Control definition\n(JSON signal map)" as definition
component "Microcode generator" as generator
artifact "EEPROM image\n(.rom / .hex)" as rom
asm --> lexer --> parser --> symbols --> assembler --> obj
note bottom of lexer : Intended pipeline view.
note bottom of assembler : Current CLI uses line-based parser in Assembler.cpp.
obj --> emulator
emulator --> ram
emulator --> output
definition --> generator --> rom
rom ..> "Physical TTL control EEPROM" : programmed into
@enduml
